msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-page.php:271
msgid "Blocks fake POST requests sent directly to the endpoint without loading the page first."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-page.php:274
msgid "Warning:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-page.php:275
msgid "A WordPress nonce expires after roughly 12-24 hours. If you use full-page caching with a long lifetime, cached pages will keep serving an old, expired nonce, and view counting will silently stop working on those pages until the cache is refreshed. Leave this off on sites with long-lived page caching, or make sure the cache is purged/refreshed at least once a day."
msgstr ""

